{"slug":"kimanno","title":"Kim Anno","nav":"Kim Anno","desc":"","img":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/dcdca348-09d0-4d79-aaa0-137a8cc21863/Anno2+copy.jpg","updated":1670948371339,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<h3><em>The Albertine Workout</em> </h3><p><strong>Anne Carson &amp; Kim Anno</strong></p>"},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"row","cols":[{"span":6,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><em>The Albertine Workout</em> is a collaboration between artist Kim Anno and author Anne Carson. The book combines text and images exploring the life and times of Proust's character Albertine, the unique and unforgettable \"captive\" from Book V of <em>Remembrances of Things Past</em>. Albertine may or may not have been based on a real person in Proust's life, his erstwhile chauffeur, Alfred Agostinelli. There is a deep, sweet pathos in the unknowable relation between these two beloveds, with Proust in between.</p>"}]},{"span":6,"blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/dcdca348-09d0-4d79-aaa0-137a8cc21863/Anno2+copy.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 1","cap":"","w":6681,"h":3024,"href":null,"fp":"0.3114754098360656,0.45945945945945943"}]}]},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"gallery","imgs":[{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465865303-UXKQY3WB98T9DG7NPLZG/titlepage.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 2","cap":"","w":800,"h":519},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465865716-WRNCZ8NIZ258BGNU1HIE/whiteblackhole.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 3","cap":"","w":800,"h":516},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465862559-AETVXMUCMIWL6VWL6X2O/backofhead.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 4","cap":"","w":800,"h":510},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465863469-GSDO1DQ124BVHTB1GHMR/browncuts.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 5","cap":"","w":800,"h":521},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465862570-FDWVUOST7SQH980HY0W5/blackcloth.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 6","cap":"","w":800,"h":522},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465863022-88DXVI6FTGILGBLWRWZG/bluesky.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 7","cap":"","w":800,"h":522},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465865652-0UYBPNOJ6M0N0BN9T5J8/twoheads.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 8","cap":"","w":800,"h":471},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465863940-SVLS0V5RWM04BO0TIY6K/foldingstar.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 9","cap":"","w":800,"h":519},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465864371-796WS71AMWBGUPAR93UO/goldensheetsm.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 10","cap":"","w":800,"h":519},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465863903-KJGHB0I8KCRWTMMNGJHQ/coolcut.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 11","cap":"","w":800,"h":519},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465864800-NO4SID2BMML58J7JH197/plant.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 12","cap":"","w":800,"h":525},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465864444-QYUC6QZ3QKQ9SXGGYQ2W/pinkstar.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 13","cap":"","w":800,"h":516},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465864899-3UMPZ5U4UNQ31M1QDLSI/redcrack.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 14","cap":"","w":800,"h":521},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465853510-OKOMOKZ4HZAL8FROVFXN/womanface.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 15","cap":"","w":800,"h":517},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465863005-DF9QO8B095UXX5BOH9B0/blackwhitehole.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 16","cap":"","w":800,"h":524},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1669465863479-VG5UEUMO70F99E5D2KPZ/colophon-sm.jpg","alt":"Kim Anno — image 17","cap":"","w":800,"h":503}]},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"row","cols":[{"span":7,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>Kim Anno</strong> (b. 1958, USA) is a painter, photographer, and film/video artist whose work has been influenced by abstract art and abstraction remains prominent in Anno's practice, with resulting work that remains \"open, playful, and engaged with a difficult ephemeral beauty.\" Anno collaborates with other artists and musicians, integrating video, sculpture, sound, and interactivity in performative installations. Recipient of the Wallace Alexander Gerbode Foundation Purchase Award and the Eureka Foundation's Fleishhacker Fellowship, Anno has been a professor at the California College of the Arts since 1996. Anno’s work is held in numerous collections both nationally and internationally. For more information, visit  http://www.kimanno.com/</p>"}]},{"span":5,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>Specifications / Credits</strong></p><p>Title:<em> The Albertine WorkOut</em> <br/>Author: Anne Carson<br/>Artist: Kim Anno<br/>Year: 2014<br/>Process: Letterpress &amp; Hand-pulled photogravure <br/>Photogravure: Unai San Martin<br/>Print Size: 9x12in<br/>Edition: 40<br/>Collection: Kim Anno</p>"}]}]}]}